+
+
+  /****************************************************************************
+   * WebRtcIsacfix_DecodePlcNb(...)
+   *
+   * This function conducts PLC for ISAC frame(s) in narrow-band (8kHz sampling).
+   * Output speech length  will be "240*noOfLostFrames" samples
